    {
      "path": "docs/conventions/naming.md",
      "lines": [
        "# Naming conventions",
        "",
        "| Affix | Kind | Meaning |",
        "|---|---|---|",
        "| `SM_` | prefix | static mesh |",
        "| `SK_` | prefix | skeletal mesh |",
        "| `T_` | prefix | texture |",
        "| `M_` | prefix | material |",
        "| `MI_` | prefix | material instance |",
        "| `MF_` | prefix | material function |",
        "| `_D` | suffix | base colour/diffuse |",
        "| `_N` | suffix | normal |",
        "| `_ORM` | suffix | occlusion-roughness-metallic |"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "docs/conventions/units-axes.md",
      "lines": [
        "# Units and axes",
        "",
        "Record the project's chosen unit scale and coordinate hand-off rules below.",
        "",
        "| Tool | Default unit | Default up axis |",
        "|---|---|---|",
        "| Blender | metres | Z-up |",
        "| Houdini | metres | Y-up |",
        "| Unreal Engine 5 | centimetres | Z-up |",
        "| Godot | metres | Y-up |",
        "| three.js | unitless/metres | Y-up |"
      ]
    },
