        "  - REPLACE"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "dcc/blender/AGENTS.md",
      "lines": [
        "# Blender (`dcc/blender/`)",
        "",
        "Shared studio Blender tooling, assets and lookdev setups.",
        "",
        "## Folders",
        "- `addons/`: Studio Blender add-ons.",
        "- `scripts/`: Python scripts and batch utilities.",
        "- `startup/`: Startup hooks and default configuration.",
        "- `presets/`: Operator and exporter presets.",
        "- `asset_library/`: Shared node groups, materials and marked assets.",
        "- `scenes/`: Lookdev, lighting rigs and turntable setups.",
        "- `templates/`: Application and scene templates.",
        "",
        "## Rules",
        "- Keep only studio-wide Blender tools and reusable setups here; per-asset `.blend` files belong in that asset's `source/blender/` folder (`*.blend[0-9]*` backups are ignored by Git).",
        "- Blender uses metres and Z-up (`docs/conventions/units-axes.md`); export Unreal meshes/animations to the asset's `export/fbx/` and Godot/web source meshes to `export/glb/`.",
        "- Render asset turntables and thumbnails into that asset's `preview/` folder; render shot sequences and playblasts to root `renders/`."
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "dcc/houdini/AGENTS.md",
      "lines": [
        "# Houdini (`dcc/houdini/`)",
        "",
        "Shared studio Houdini packages, HDAs, VEX headers, scripts and TOPs workflows.",
        "",
        "## Folders",
        "- `packages/`: Houdini `.json` package definitions.",
        "- `otls/`: Studio-wide Houdini Digital Assets (HDAs).",
        "- `scripts/`: Scene and event scripts.",
        "- `python3.11libs/`: Shared Python modules loaded by Houdini.",
        "- `toolbar/`: Custom shelf definitions (`.shelf`).",
        "- `presets/`: Node and parameter presets.",
        "- `vex/`: Shared VEX headers and snippets.",
        "- `hip/`: Reusable template scenes and studio setups.",
        "- `pdg/`: TOPs / PDG batch graph workflows.",
        "",
        "## Rules",
        "- Put studio-wide HDAs in `otls/` and shared template scenes in `hip/`; asset-specific `.hip` scenes and asset-local HDAs belong in that asset's `source/houdini/`, and shot FX setups in `shots/<seq>/<shot>/fx/`.",
        "- Write all working simulation and geometry caches (`.bgeo.sc`, `.vdb`, sims, flipbooks) to root `cache/` only.",
        "- Houdini uses metres and Y-up (`docs/conventions/units-axes.md`); publish final meshes, animations and volumes for handoff to the asset's `export/` (`fbx/`, `glb/`, `usd/`, `abc/`, `vdb/`)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "engines/ue5/AGENTS.md",
      "lines": [
        "# Unreal Engine 5 (`engines/ue5/`)",
        "",
        "Unreal Engine 5 workspace (`Studio/`, centimetres, Z-up). Initialize `Studio/Studio.uproject` from Unreal Editor.",
        "",
        "## Folders",
        "- `Studio/Config/`: Engine and project `.ini` configuration.",
        "- `Studio/Source/`: C++ modules (`Studio/` runtime, `StudioEditor/` editor).",
        "- `Studio/Plugins/`: Project-scoped Unreal plugins.",
        "- `Studio/Content/`: `/Game/` tree (`_Dev/`, `Characters/`, `Props/`, `Environments/`, `Materials/`, `Textures/`, `VFX/`, `Animations/`, `Blueprints/`, `UI/`, `Audio/`, `Cinematics/`, `Data/`, `Maps/`).",
        "",
        "## Rules",
        "- Populate `Studio/Content/` by importing meshes/animations from an asset's `export/fbx/` (plus `export/abc/`, `export/vdb/` or `export/usd/` when needed) and textures from `textures/baked/` or `library/textures/`, while authoring Unreal-native assets (Blueprints, `.umap` maps, `M_`/`MI_`/`MF_` materials, Niagara, Level Sequences, UMG, DataAssets) in Unreal Editor; never put `.blend`, `.hip`, `.ztl` or `.spp` files here.",
        "- Put unreviewed Unreal assets in `Studio/Content/_Dev/` before promoting them to shared `Content/` folders (scratch files outside the engines belong in `.agents/lanes/<agent>/`).",
        "- Follow `docs/conventions/naming.md` for Unreal asset prefixes and texture suffixes, and never hand-edit `.uasset` or `.umap` binaries.",
        "- `Binaries/`, `Intermediate/`, `Saved/` and `DerivedDataCache/` (including under `Plugins/*/`) are generated by Unreal and ignored by Git."
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "engines/godot/AGENTS.md",
      "lines": [
        "# Godot (`engines/godot/`)",
        "",
        "Godot workspace (`studio/`, metres, Y-up). Initialize `studio/project.godot` and `studio/export_presets.cfg` from the Godot editor.",
        "",
        "## Folders",
        "- `studio/addons/`: Editor plugins and add-ons.",
        "- `studio/assets/`: Imported assets and Godot shaders/materials (`models/`, `textures/`, `materials/`, `shaders/`, `audio/`, `fonts/`).",
        "- `studio/scenes/`: Scene trees (`.tscn`) under `levels/`, `actors/`, `props/` and `ui/`.",
        "- `studio/scripts/`: GDScript files (`.gd`).",
        "- `studio/autoload/`: Singleton autoload scripts and scenes.",
        "- `studio/resources/`: Custom `.tres` resources.",
        "- `studio/tests/`: Unit and scene tests.",
        "",
        "## Rules",
        "- Import 3D models into `studio/assets/models/` from the asset's `export/glb/` and textures into `studio/assets/textures/` from the asset's `textures/baked/` or `library/textures/`; author Godot-native scenes (`.tscn`), scripts (`.gd`), resources (`.tres`) and shaders (`.gdshader`) in Godot, and never put `.blend`, `.hip`, `.ztl` or `.spp` files here.",
        "- Let Godot generate and update `.import` sidecars (committed) and `.godot/` cache data (ignored by Git); never hand-write `.import` files."
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "web/AGENTS.md",
      "lines": [
        "# Web / Three.js (`web/`)",
        "",
        "Three.js front end (metres, Y-up). Create `package.json` with the package manager or project scaffolder; config files such as `vite.config.ts` and `tsconfig.json` are ordinary source files in `web/`.",
        "",
        "## Folders",
        "- `public/`: Static files served directly (`models/`, `textures/`, `hdri/`, `decoders/`, `fonts/`).",
        "- `src/`: Application source (`scenes/`, `components/`, `materials/`, `shaders/`, `loaders/`, `postfx/`, `ui/`, `lib/`).",
        "- `tests/`: Web front-end tests.",
        "",
        "## Rules",
        "- Implement and verify conversion scripts first; none are included. Store converted models and textures under web/public/.",
        "- Never place DCC sources (`.blend`, `.hip`, `.ztl`, `.spp`) or uncompressed authoring textures (`.exr`, `.psd`, `.tif`) under `web/`.",
        "- `dist/` and `node_modules/` are generated build/install output and are ignored by Git."
      ]
    },
